  "assistantCloudOff": "Off. Everything is done on this phone.",
  "assistantHowItWorks": "Your log stays on your phone. Your notes and your log are read by femio's rules and, where your phone has it, by Gemini Nano on the phone. Safety rules always come first: signs of danger open the help page, and femio never advises on avoiding pregnancy. Ask femio answers only from trusted health sources carried in the app and shows them with every answer. Cloud boost is off unless you agree to it; then only what its screen lists is sent to Google.",
