  "boostTurnOff": "Turn off Cloud boost",
  "boostNotNow": "Not now",
  "boostAgreeQuestions": "I agree that femio may send a general question I approve, one at a time, with the public sources it found, so Google's cloud AI can summarise them. femio removes numbers, dates, names and contacts first, and I see the exact text before it goes.",
  "boostAgreeTips": "I agree that femio may send these four broad facts about my health, exactly as shown, so Google's cloud AI can put my tips in order. This happens in the background while Cloud boost is on.",
  "boostPurposeQuestions": "General questions",
  "boostPurposeTips": "Tips from four broad facts",
  "boostWhoHeading": "Who receives it, and where",
  "boostWho": "Google processes it for femio through Firebase AI Logic (the Gemini Developer API, paid tier). Google may process it in the United States or other countries where it has servers, under its data processing terms. femio (KM Digital Labs, Cairo, Egypt) decides what is sent and is responsible for it.",
  "boostKeptHeading": "How long it is kept",
  "boostKept": "femio has no server and keeps none of it. Under the paid terms femio uses, Google does not use it to improve its products. Google keeps it for up to 55 days to detect misuse, and people at Google may review content that its systems flag as misuse.",
  "boostAlsoSeen": "Like any internet connection, Google also sees your phone's internet address, and a check from Google Play that the request comes from the real femio app.",
  "boostChoiceHeading": "Your choice",
  "boostChoice": "Agreeing is optional, and you can agree to one use and not the other. You can turn Cloud boost off at any time, here or in Settings › Assistant, as easily as you turned it on. Each phone asks again: a restored backup does not carry your agreement.",
  "boostReadNotice": "Read the privacy notice",
  "boostExplicit": "These facts and questions are about your health. By ticking a box and pressing I agree, you give your explicit consent to that use only. femio keeps a dated record of your choice on this phone, which you can see here.",
  "boostAgree": "I agree",
